Entries for the Delaware QSO Party used by in-state stations
50 states + 13 Canadian provinces and territories; the three Delaware counties count as De
(delaware_cty.dom maps each county to De). DXCC entities are the DX multiplier.
The county file comes FIRST, so the S48.DOM line for De is read after it and the
multiplier keeps the name Delaware rather than the last county name.
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.
https://www.fsarc.org/qsoparty/rules-2024.html

INCLUDE FILE delaware_cty.dom
INCLUDE FILE S50.DOM
INCLUDE FILE P13.DOM
